    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to 75 The Eglinton, Donnybrook Castle, a superb two bedroomed, second floor apartment, ideally located in this much sought after gated development of apartments and town houses built by Shannon Homes in 1996. \n\nSet amidst beautifully landscaped gardens and minutes' walk from Donnybrook Village, this lovely bright apartment enjoys a wonderful outlook over the gardens and comes to the market in very good decorative order throughout. In brief, the accommodation comprises of entrance hall with attractive flooring, a cloakroom and an additional storage press and an open plan living /dining room with access to the private balcony. There is a separate kitchen, two double bedrooms (main ensuite with access to the balcony) and a large bathroom. The property has the added bonus of a designated car parking space and ample visitor parking. \n \nThe location is second to none, this prestigious Dublin 4 address is withing proximity to Dublin City Centre, local fitness clubs include Riverview, Donnybrook Tennis Club, Elm Park and Milltown Golf Clubs and the Aviva Stadium. The Quality Bus Corridor is to the front of the property with easy access to the City Centre. RTE and UCD are a few minutes' walk away and the Aircoach is on the doorstep providing easy access to the airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nwith attractive flooring, cloak cupboard and storage press. Hot press with good storage and an additional storage press, ceiling coving and T.V intercom.\n\nLiving/Dining: - \nlovely open plan reception room with attractive fireplace and coal effect gas fire, ceiling coving, attractive flooring. Door to the balcony.\n\nKitchen: - \nwith built-in wall and floor presses, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan. Integrated dishwasher and fridge freezer. Plumbed for washing machine Tiled floor.\n\nMain Bedroom: - \nsuperb double bedroom with access to the balcony.\n\nEnsuite Shower Room: - \nwith shower cubicle, w.c. and wash hand basin, tiled walls and tiled floor. Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nbright and spacious double bedroom.\n\nBathroom: - \nwith bath, shower attachment, w.c. and wash hand basin, part tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
      {
